      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/5f9b8f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-17T19:17:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The booth had a sales area as well as two long tables. We had 4 demo boxes set up enough for 2, 5 player games and 2, 3 player games (limited due to space/chairs). The place was jumping pretty consistanly when I worked. I briefly saw a Ra costume :) We had some times when there were a few people waiting to get the game, but they were efficent in getting them their Sentinels Fix! My wife had someone stop her in the middle of the convention to remark how awesome the blue Sentinel's Shirt was, and to tell her how to beat Iron Legacy :) Good times all around!</p>",
